<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Targeted Genetics upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Targeted Genetics upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Vector Securities International Inc said Friday it upgraded its rating on Targeted Genetics Corp to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>--It cited price weakness and said the company's cystic fibrosis gene therapy program has generated strong interest from potential partners. &quot;It now appears that the company could form a major partnership with a world-class biopharma firm as early as this quarter or next,&quot; Vector said.</p>
<p>--This and other near-term milestones could drive Targeted Genetics' shares back to the $6 price level, Vector added.</p>
<p>--Targeted Genetics was up 1/4 at 3-1/4.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
